sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Request Producer
    participant MQ as Message Queue<br/>(Redis / GCP Pub/Sub)
    participant Runner as llm-d-async Runner<br/>pipeline.Flow
    participant MergePolicy as Merge Policy<br/>(random-robin)
    participant Gate as Flow Control Gate<br/>(Prometheus-driven)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    participant Transform as Transform Chain<br/>(plugins)
    participant Worker as Async Worker<br/>HTTP Client
    participant ModelServer as Model Server<br/>HTTP/HTTPS + mTLS

    Note over Client, ModelServer: Inference Request Pipeline

    Client->>MQ: Publish inference request<br/>to named queue
    MQ->>Runner: Consume request<br/>(transport-specific poll)
    Runner->>MergePolicy: Map queue → worker pool
    MergePolicy-->>Runner: Selected worker pool
    Runner->>Gate: Check dispatch condition
    Gate->>Prometheus: Query backpressure metrics<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    Prometheus-->>Gate: Metric values
    Gate-->>Runner: Allow / block dispatch

    alt Gate allows dispatch
        Runner->>Worker: Dispatch request to pool
        Worker->>Transform: Apply request body transforms
        Transform-->>Worker: Transformed request
        Worker->>ModelServer: POST inference request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (TLS 1.2+, optional mTLS)
        ModelServer-->>Worker: Inference response
        Worker->>MQ: Write result to result channel
    else Gate blocks (backpressure)
        Note over Runner: Wait and retry
    end

    Note over Runner, ModelServer: Health & Metrics Surface

    participant Kubelet as Kubelet
    participant MetricsSvr as Metrics Server<br/>Port 9090

    Kubelet->>Runner: GET /healthz (port 8081)<br/>Unauthenticated
    Runner-->>Kubelet: 200 OK / 503
    Kubelet->>Runner: GET /readyz (port 8081)<br/>Unauthenticated
    Runner-->>Kubelet: 200 OK / 503

    participant ScrapeClient as Metrics Scraper
    ScrapeClient->>MetricsSvr: GET /metrics (port 9090)<br/>K8s Bearer Token
    MetricsSvr-->>ScrapeClient: Prometheus metrics

    Note over Worker, ModelServer: Observability Egress

    participant OTELCollector as OTLP Collector<br/>(gRPC)
    Worker->>OTELCollector: Export traces<br/>gRPC (otlptracegrpc)
